WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:04.600
Your general accepts the order General Zhenbei Chen Ying.

00:04.920 --> 00:11.040
Your general is here I order you to lead one army follow the Luoshui northward enter northern Qing Province.

00:11.120 --> 00:16.840
Take Wuyang City with Yiyang facing each other north and south remember Wuyang and Yiyang.

00:16.920 --> 00:23.360
Form a line supporting each other like horns with these two cities can we ensure our supply lines are clear.

00:23.440 --> 00:25.920
If lost military law will be applied.

00:26.000 --> 00:27.667
Your general accepts the order.

00:55.320 --> 00:56.720
Alert.

00:59.120 --> 01:01.880
Catch him lest the Wutu learn our movements.

